    "blurb": "The early‑show captures the band in a tight mid‑summer groove, delivering strong renditions of Morning Dew, China Cat Sunflower > High Time and Dire Wolf. The audience tape is surprisingly listenable for 1969, making this a worthwhile snapshot of the Owsley era.",
